
meh (unreleased) - Display depths other than 24 bit: 15, 16, packed 24, 10 bit, and palettised down to 16 colours. Visual chosen on merit. Dithering for coarse displays.
meh 0.3 - Preliminary caching support. Improved responsiveness. PNG alpha support.
meh 0.2 - Imagemagick support. netpbm support. Better downscaling. Bug fixes.
meh 0.1 - First release. JPEG, PNG, GIF and BMP formats. XSHM support.

